Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.36,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,High school is no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:08.24,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,I wanna go back to middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:12.24,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H9A4B0C&\3c&HE8EEC3&\fs20\frz348.4\pos(499.2,120.4)}MIDDLE SCHOOL\NALUMNI GATHERING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:11.05,Flashback,Mocchin,0,0,0,,That's all you keep saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:13.18,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,Nothing beats the old homestead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:14.87,Flashback,Mocchin,0,0,0,,No one uses that word anymore, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:17.25,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Your friends came with you \Nto the culture festival, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:20.45,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,Individually, all my friends \Nare good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:22.70,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,But I just don't vibe with \Nthe overall feel of the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:23.50,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Is it gloomy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:24.42,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:26.51,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,It always feels like there's \Nthis empty silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:28.74,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,And there's an overwhelming \Nlack of idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:30.51,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,How are we supposed \Nto take that statement?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:33.33,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,I don't mean academically. \NI mean the fun kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:36.52,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,Third year of middle school after \Nclasses was the best, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:40.53,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,When the three of us—me, Yamada, and Miyu—\Ndid that after-school study group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.53,0:00:42.50,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,That was seriously so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:44.16,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HA6FFFD&\3c&H0659E1&\frz15.46\pos(60,38)\fnTrebuchet MS}AH HA HA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:42.75,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HE5C0F9&\3c&H8205C7&\pos(487.2,44.4)\frz19.21\fnTrebuchet MS}HEE HEE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:44.77,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You mean the one where we \Nbasically just talked, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.77,0:00:48.03,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,All I remember is rolling with laughter \Nat conversations with no substance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:49.73,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,Exactly! That's what I liked!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.73,0:00:51.28,Flashback,Mocchin,0,0,0,,His vehemence is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:53.30,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,We were students testing into high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:56.29,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,but we had no after-school activities, \Nleaving us with such a sense of freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:01:00.04,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,That rush of emotion from thinking, \N"Let's graduate without any regrets!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:03.04,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,The afternoon sun shining into \Nthe classroom... The melancholy feels...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:04.92,Flashback,Mocchin,0,0,0,,He's monologuing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:06.17,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\frz27.71\move(437,90.6,423,26)\fad(1,355)\c&HBCF882&\3c&H86540B&}POUT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:08.48,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,Although, Yamada got a girlfriend \Npartway through and stopped coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:09.59,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,For real, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:11.96,Flashback - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey! That doesn't make me \Nthe bad guy here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:12.80,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\frz7.859\move(353,423,353,323,1,481)}FLASHBACK TO\NTHE PREVIOUS EPISODE...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.34,0:01:15.10,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,Sometimes, around dusk,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:18.91,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,for no reason, I'll take a walk down \Nthe route I took to middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:19.93,Flashback,Mocchin,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.93,0:01:22.82,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,When I hear them singing choir \Nsongs we sang in middle school,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.82,0:01:24.81,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,I really feel like I'm about to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:26.59,Flashback,Mocchin,0,0,0,,He's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.59,0:01:28.34,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,When you're having fun in the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.34,0:01:32.60,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,you don't realize how lucky \Nyou are to be in that environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:34.57,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,...is what Ricchan was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:36.70,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I feel like he must have it pretty rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:38.58,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:41.14,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,He's just too hung up on the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.14,0:01:42.96,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,That's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:47.21,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I can't empathisize with someone saying \N"middle school was too much fun."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:51.42,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,And why was Suzuki attending \Nthis gathering like it was normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:52.47,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You okay with that, Tani?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:01:56.29,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah. I think it's probably fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:01:59.14,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,And overthinking everything \Nmakes it seem like I don't trust her,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:00.72,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,which feels disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.46,0:02:03.20,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thanks for being worried about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.40,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Why are you getting more confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:07.23,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Is that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.26,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:10.99,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\frz9.914\pos(453.6,66.8)\fad(483,1)\c&H714B09&\3c&HF2FE9D&}DON'T LEAVE ME\NBEHIND, TANI...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.26,0:02:10.36,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.41,0:02:28.21,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,115)\fnArial}YOU AND I ARE POLAR OPPOSITES
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:43.07,Default,girl A,0,0,0,,What are you getting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.37,0:03:45.25,Default - Top,girl B,0,0,0,,I'm in the mood for chicken curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:48.02,Default - Top,girl A,0,0,0,,Then I think I'll get \Nthe chicken hayashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:49.12,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, \Nthere's this guy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:52.03,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,I might be headed toward \Nfalling in love right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:54.70,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,What happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:56.13,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Did he make any progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:04:01.64,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,No. I won't ask any questions \Nuntil Yamada brings it up himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:04.89,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,If it didn't go well, \NI have nothing I can say to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:08.02,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,And even if it did go well, \NI still have nothing to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:09.90,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial\pos(589.091,209.636)\fad(394,1)\c&HD8FF6E&\bord0}(BECAUSE\NI'D\NFEEL\NCONFLICTED\NABOUT\NIT)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:12.65,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I'm just so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:18.15,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H513515&\fs16\move(112,416,112,346,1,315)\bord1}STAND-IN COMMENTATOR
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:18.40,Default - Top,Yeti,0,0,0,,On the day of the culture festival, \Nthis is what happened to Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.18,0:04:21.69,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Is this one you took?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:22.64,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:24.48,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Really? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:29.54,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HA1D310&\pos(319.273,248.182)\fnTrebuchet MS\fad(517,1)}SILENCE . . .
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:31.30,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.55,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm nervous again, \Nso this conversation isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:36.82,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,"I'm sorry my replies to the messages you \Nsent over summer break were so awful."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:39.55,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,"I'm sorry that it seemed like \NI was rejecting you."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.34,0:04:43.32,Flashback,Nishi; simultaneous,0,0,0,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.34,0:04:43.32,Flashback,Yamada; simultaneous,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:45.56,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,Please, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.56,0:04:46.56,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:47.68,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:50.15,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,For texting you... and everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:54.57,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,If you're not close, wouldn't it be scary \Nto suddenly be asked for contact info?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.87,0:04:57.26,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,I thought maybe I've been too pushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:05:00.20,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Like, given the distance \Nbetween us and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:03.42,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,I'll think a little more before I act.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:04.07,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.44,0:05:07.17,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Nishi-san, what were you going to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:09.33,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:11.63,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:15.66,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,My phone... Up until now, \NI've used it to contact my parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:17.97,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,and once in a while, I message Hon-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:21.34,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,or other girls I'm friends with, \Nbut that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:24.50,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,I overthink about whether \NI've written anything weird
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:26.57,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,or made typos, and it slows me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:29.55,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,And yet, I still send \Nridiculously long texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.55,0:05:33.60,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,And then I think too much about what \Nwould happen if I went silent on a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:35.36,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:38.48,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,It wasn't that I didn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:42.11,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,Being scared of making mistakes \Nmakes me overthink everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:46.12,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,I want to be able \Nto not overthink so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.11,0:05:50.07,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,You and I are polar opposites.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.07,0:05:51.71,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,When you sent something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:54.54,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,it made me so happy that \NI'd reply right away without thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:57.50,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,I never thought you wrote anything weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:06:00.13,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fad(518,438)\frz78.25\pos(473.455,102.727)\c&H8357DE&\bord2}Thank goodness
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:02.24,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,And I'm nowhere near as concerned about \Ndetails as you think I am, Nishi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:03.38,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.79,0:06:06.37,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,You should just make mistakes! With me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.37,0:06:07.26,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:07.26,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H78EDFB&\3c&H7469E0&\fs24\frz24.44\fnTrebuchet MS\pos(169.09,254.909)}WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.26,0:06:10.21,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Because I'm not someone you need \Nto be careful around at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:11.51,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,We're peers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:14.12,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,And if I'm being annoying, \Nyou can just say, "Ugh, what a pain!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:16.81,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,And if I'm making too much noise, \Nyou can just say, "Shut up, stupid!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.65,0:06:20.15,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that! Not that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:23.39,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,"You're being entirely too loud."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:26.56,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'm not that elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:30.16,Basic Sign,SIGN; large,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\fnArial\fs24\bord1\frz346.3\pos(365.091,167.455)}RIHITO
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:30.16,Basic Sign,SIGN; smaller,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\fnArial\fs16\bord1\frz346.3\pos(336,251.091)}INCOMING CALL
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:30.16,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Ricchan! I forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:32.91,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,I'm gonna head out. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:38.17,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Is it okay for me \Nto talk to you at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:40.61,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:43.10,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Then let's talk again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:47.88,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,And thus, they managed\N to make a little progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:52.61,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Ever since the culture festival, \Nhe's been in an oddly good mood,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:55.56,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,and he's clearly been looking for \Nsomeone while we've been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:58.53,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna bite. I won't bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:07:01.10,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yamada-kun, are you looking for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:02.94,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:03.95,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Gapacho.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:05.76,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I'm not biting! You hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:07.95,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I won't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:10.20,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,But I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:13.16,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Both Yamada and Tani \Nare good guys to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:14.46,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\bord2\pos(563,232)}THINKING\NABOUT IT
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:19.21,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Of course there's someone who likes them, \Nand they're able to accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:21.46,Flashback,Taira's ex girlfriend,0,0,0,,Sorry, Taira-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:24.67,Flashback,Taira's ex girlfriend,0,0,0,,Your personality's kinda different \Nthan I thought it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.65,0:07:28.84,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Don't remember stuff you hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:33.93,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,What that friend of Yamada's said...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:37.36,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,that middle school was so much \Nfun and high school isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:39.35,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Basically, it's a contrast thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:44.17,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Not being able to choose your elementary \Nor middle school makes them more hellish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:48.14,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Even if he acknowledged that, \Nfrom my perspective, I'd still be jealo—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:08:00.75,Basic Sign,SIGN; ribbon,0,0,0,,{\fs24\frz31.07\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HA15BD4&\move(1.091,77.455,96,83,24,357)}MOUTHING
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:58.25,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HAFB824&\fs24\frz33.09\pos(58.181,129.636)}FLAP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:07:58.62,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HAFB824&\fs24\frz33.09\pos(123.636,236.545)}FLAP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:07:59.00,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HAFB824&\fs24\frz33.09\pos(198.545,55.454)}FLAP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:07:59.37,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HAFB824&\fs24\frz33.09\pos(50.181,215.454)}FLAP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.09,0:08:00.89,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You weren't saying anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:07:59.75,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HAFB824&\fs24\frz33.09\pos(198.545,55.454)}FLAP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:00.13,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HAFB824&\fs24\frz33.09\pos(50.181,215.454)}FLAP
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:00.50,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HAFB824&\fs24\frz33.09\pos(198.545,55.454)}FLAP
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:07.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I tricked you! I tricked you! \NI tricked you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:07.13,Default - Top,Taira,0,0,0,,Don't interfere with my music time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:08.68,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,And don't you laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:10.18,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm not laughing.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.22,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.51,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\frz19.73\move(242,461,192,311,1,732)\c&HCEC510&\bord1\fad(440,1)}OTHERWISE THERE'S\NNO POINT IN MY\NGETTING TRICKED...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.22,0:08:12.12,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.51,0:08:14.83,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Taira doesn't usually head \Ntoward the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:16.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That means he must be working today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:18.14,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Das right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:21.46,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Then I guess I'll head to the convenience \Nstore before going home! Okay, Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:22.31,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:22.83,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:24.02,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Don't just say "sure."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:26.82,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We'll only stop by for a little while, \Nso make us some soft serve!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:28.94,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,We don't have a machine \Nfor that at our shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:32.03,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,And when we get there, \Nit'll still be the shift before mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:33.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:34.93,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, can you wait for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:35.74,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:36.44,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:37.89,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,That's where you hesitate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:41.46,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You're so funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:43.07,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Why do you only come \Nwhen I'm there, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:43.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:46.05,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Because it's more fun \Nwhen you're there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:50.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right, Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:50.78,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:55.16,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh. Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.45,0:09:02.62,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:06.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The ice cream I just bought was a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:08.19,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Hurry up and go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.97,0:09:15.34,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Yamada-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:19.33,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do? D-Do I say hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:17.20,Basic Sign,SIGN. sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HA45BED&\frz16.7\pos(513.455,200.727)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:17.70,Basic Sign,SIGN. sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HA45BED&\frz16.7\pos(198.546,273.454)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:18.20,Basic Sign,SIGN. sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HA45BED&\frz16.7\pos(513.455,200.727)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:18.70,Basic Sign,SIGN. sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HA45BED&\frz16.7\pos(198.546,273.454)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:19.20,Basic Sign,SIGN. sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HA45BED&\frz16.7\pos(513.455,200.727)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:19.33,Basic Sign,SIGN. sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HA45BED&\frz16.7\pos(198.546,273.454)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:21.83,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,M-Me, talk first? Can I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:24.66,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,You should just make mistakes! With me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:24.08,Basic Sign,SIGN. sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&HA523B6&\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\frz24.42\pos(316.363,247.454)\fs24}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:24.84,Basic Sign,SIGN. sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&HA523B6&\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\fs24\pos(577.454,55.454)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:25.34,Basic Sign,SIGN. sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&HA523B6&\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\frz24.42\pos(316.363,247.454)\fs24}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.23,0:09:26.34,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.34,0:09:27.96,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh! Nishi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:28.59,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:30.09,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\frz290.3\move(140,427,80,227,1,1062)\c&HC8FFA7&\3c&H7F721A&\fad(1,313)}GLOOM...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:30.02,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,"Eek"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.99,0:09:32.84,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, no, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:37.07,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I was fully determined to say \Nhello to you, but you said it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.07,0:09:40.10,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What's that about? It's funny that \Nyou were determined about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:43.10,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,He thinks what I did was funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:44.61,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\c&HAA7DF2&\3c&H6B2775&\4c&H6B2775&\bord1\shad1\frz21.98\pos(202.91,211.818)}SAVE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:46.86,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,H-Hon-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.86,0:09:48.22,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:49.11,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:52.78,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Good. Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:54.36,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What's with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.87,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,In spite of everything, \Nyou seem to be getting along well!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:00.12,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,So, Nisshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:02.05,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,what do you think of Yamada so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.05,0:10:02.83,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.03,0:10:07.63,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,My heart pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.43,0:10:09.63,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.35,0:10:11.30,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:12.63,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I don't know how to put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:15.89,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I wonder what this feeling could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:19.31,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs48\an8\c&HC5FFFF&\3c&HDA83E1&}BA-DUMP...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:18.92,Default,shojo character,0,0,0,,I wonder what this feeling could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:22.36,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,There are people in real life \Nwho actually say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.89,0:10:22.89,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\frz20.58\move(160,189,155,189,1,856)\c&HD7FF45&\3c&H9D7A4C&\bord1\fad(856,1)}I'VE SEEN IT...\NI'VE SEEN IT BEFORE...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:27.40,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You mean like, "I wonder what this \Ntingling in the depths of my chest is"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.40,0:10:30.76,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, no. It's nothing so fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:32.30,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Not fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:38.89,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's Yamada-kun or the \Nsituation that is making my heart pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:40.66,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\frz356.3\move(502,165,388,149)\fad(1,730)\c&H088BEC&}Urk....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.89,0:10:41.66,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Wow. That's a lot more realistic \Nthan I thought it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:44.30,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,My experience in talking with \Nboys is so drastically lacking that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:47.76,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,my heart pounds really hard and it's \Ndifficult to know why it's pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.76,0:10:51.12,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Even if it wasn't Yamada-kun, I think \Nmy heart would still pound like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.12,0:10:53.17,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Dear, dear. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:58.12,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Still, I'm relieved to know that \Nyou aren't too dense a heroine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:00.43,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Sorry. Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:04.63,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Actually, even if the situation is what \Nhas you going, that's not an issue, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.63,0:11:08.19,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What? But... doesn't that make it \Nseem like anyone would do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:13.32,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,But there's no point in \Nthinking about that, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:14.24,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:17.32,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Basically, in the case that your heart is \Npounding because of the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:21.08,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,the question of whether your heart would \Npound if it was someone other than Yamada
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:23.21,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,is what you get hung up on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.21,0:11:24.21,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:27.95,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Nisshi, at the present moment, \Ndo you have this "someone else"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.95,0:11:29.00,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:33.09,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Then, aren't you comparing Yamada \Nto something that doesn't exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:35.35,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,"But what if things were like this..."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.35,0:11:37.62,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,That's a worry that you \Ncreated out of nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.62,0:11:39.36,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,and you can create \Nthose infinitely, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:42.97,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,If you're going to be bothered by \Nsomething, better reality than what-ifs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.34,0:11:46.14,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be better to go with a simple,\N "How do I feel about this person?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:48.98,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I-I see. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:53.39,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Then, first, I need to be able \Nto talk without getting nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:55.57,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,In the end, that's always the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:56.99,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\move(800,261,500,261,563,897)\fnTrebuchet MS}BACK TO THE START AGAIN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:56.99,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.99,0:12:01.49,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Don't worry! Whether it's a boy or \Na girl, in the end, everyone's human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:04.90,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Hon-chan is kind of scary sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:06.25,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You'll get used to it over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.65,0:12:10.31,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,And whether your heart's pounding \Nbecause you're nervous and shy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:14.25,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,or because of the irregular situation, \Nor because of a specific person...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.89,0:12:17.26,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,I hope you'll figure out \Nwhat's causing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:18.37,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:25.47,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Hon-chan, you don't get shy around \Npeople at all, do you? I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:27.89,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,It's not even not being shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.21,0:12:32.09,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Regardless of gender, I basically \Nvaguely dislike anyone I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.09,0:12:33.52,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:40.86,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Thank you for your work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:41.91,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:45.91,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Tani-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:49.38,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Up until now, he hasn't said much, \Nso I didn't know what he was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.38,0:12:51.67,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,which scared me a little, \Nand my heart was pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:54.74,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,But because we talked a little \Nat the culture festival,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.74,0:12:57.07,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm not as nervous \Nwith him as I was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:57.92,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\frz13.43\pos(564.364,323.819)\fad(307,1)\c&H9F25BD&}THAT WAS\N"BEING SHY"\NHEART POUNDING...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:04.93,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Suzuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:07.62,Default - Top,Watanabe,0,0,0,,It went inside the building!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:08.81,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,481)\fnImpact\fs16\an1\pos(226,227)\c&HA0F7F5&\3c&H60319B&}AN "EVEN THE GOING-HOME\NCLUB WANTS TO EXERCISE!"  {\fnComic Sans MS\c&H7804A1&\3c&HD2A1F2&}GATHERING
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:08.81,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,481)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\c&H7804A1&\3c&HD2A1F2&\pos(320.727,313.636)}(HELD IRREGULARLY)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:08.77,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,That doesn't count!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:11.56,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That was the wind's fault, I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.94,0:13:15.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And Nishi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.14,0:13:16.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.19,0:13:16.88,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:21.65,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Suzuki, since when did you \Nand Nishi-san become friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:23.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? What does it matter? It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.73,0:13:24.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right, Nissan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.74,0:13:25.70,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:29.70,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs16\an3\bord1\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB0C338&\pos(627.455,293.576)}GOT SWEPT ALONG INTO GOING HOME TOGETHER PART OF THE WAY
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:28.79,Italics - Top,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Was it really all right for me \Nto go with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:26.95,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\frz336.7\pos(578.909,51.09)\c&HDAB71E&\fad(1,186)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:27.45,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HDAB71E&\frz14.77\pos(68,66.363)\fad(1,186)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:27.95,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HD9FFBF&\pos(517.818,99.09)\frz8.682\bord3\3c&HD0C30D&\fad(1,186)}PANIC
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:28.45,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HD9FFBF&\frz8.682\bord3\3c&HD0C30D&\pos(62,101.272)\fad(1,186)}PANIC
