Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:29.70,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fad(1,186)\c&HFDFFBB&\3c&HDFD617&\frz20.93\pos(73.091,167.455)}WORRY
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:31.57,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Were you playing badminton the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.57,0:13:33.08,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yes. Badminton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:34.18,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I may be in the Going-Home Club,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:36.09,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord3\i1\frz22.36\pos(127.272,90.364)\fad(224,1)\c&H6EFFFC&\3c&H240866&}H{\c&H5FD9FA&}E{\c&H45B5F7&}H
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:36.95,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but I have to exercise sometimes \Nor my sense for it dulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.95,0:13:38.46,Default,Sarou,0,0,0,,When was it ever sharp?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.09,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Don't talk like you're \Nsome kind of master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.09,0:13:41.95,Default,Watanabe; adlib,0,0,0,,You're already a super slow runner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:41.09,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz349.6\move(573,105,597,26)\fad(1,187)\c&H903CE4&}HNGH....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:44.59,Default,Suzuki; adlib,0,0,0,,Which Suzuki are you speaking of?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.99,0:13:44.59,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh? Was that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:48.26,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,The way the antonym of "dull" \Ncame up so quickly was funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:50.35,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,That's what was funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:55.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's kind of cold, isn't it? \NMy sweat's giving me chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.68,0:13:56.19,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.26,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hang on! This is bad! Do I reek of sweat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:02.45,Default,Suzuki; Satou; Watanabe,0,0,0,,Huh? Yamada, are you the type \Nto worry about stuff like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:03.74,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yes, I am! And don't talk in harmony!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:07.60,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, Nishi-san, \Nyou laugh a lot, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:08.44,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.49,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\frz283.2\move(80,480,30,230,1,437)\c&HE5E7BB&\3c&HBC6B1F&\4c&HBC6B1F&\shad1}HE NOTICED...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.49,0:14:12.02,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm so embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.00,0:14:10.75,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper right sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\frz344\pos(522,39)\bord1\c&H7156EC&}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:11.25,Basic Sign,SIGN; lower right sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\frz344\bord1\c&H7156EC&\pos(553,221)}THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:11.75,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper left sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\c&H7156EC&\frz337.5\pos(138.727,46.273)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.75,0:14:12.50,Basic Sign,SIGN; lower left sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\c&H7156EC&\frz15.61\pos(64.545,179.363)}BA-DUMP
