Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:14.98,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,This is the nervous kind \Nof heart pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:13.75,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper left sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\c&H7156EC&\frz337.5\pos(138.727,46.273)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:14.00,Basic Sign,SIGN; lower right sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\frz344\bord1\c&H7156EC&\pos(571.182,239.182)}THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:14.75,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper right sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\frz344\pos(522,39)\bord1\c&H7156EC&}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:18.88,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Um... I-I want to fix that about myself, \Nbut I just can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:19.66,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.01,0:14:21.66,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,That's crazy good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:24.93,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You're definitely better off \Nthe way you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:26.98,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,The nervous type of...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:29.86,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Yamada, if you're worried about \Nthe smell of your sweat,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:31.39,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,you can use the rest of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:33.39,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh? Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.64,0:14:36.88,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Satou, what scent is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:38.27,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs28\frz293.1\move(514,312,448,273)\fad(393,1)\c&HFBFBA5&\3c&HABA15C&}PSHHHHH
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.88,0:14:38.27,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh? Cool mint.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:40.78,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:43.73,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What is this?! \NMy whole body's crazy cold now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:46.03,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,That's why I don't use it anymore \Nand you can use it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:47.95,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You're just using me to get rid of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:52.54,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,The fact that I laugh easily \Nis part of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:56.09,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,but it's also because Yamada-kun is \Nsomeone who creates a fun atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:57.82,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:02.55,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs36\an8\c&HBCFAE4&\3c&H55027A&}WHABAM-THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.51,0:15:06.29,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Wait, what? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.05,0:15:08.01,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\c&H9E5DEE&\pos(162.727,64.454)\frz7.212}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:08.01,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\c&H9E5DEE&\pos(307.091,178.636)\frz346.5}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:08.01,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\c&H9E5DEE&\pos(74.727,101.545)\frz22.07}THMP
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:08.01,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\c&H9E5DEE&\frz20.13\pos(113.272,240.454)}THUMP...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:08.01,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\c&H9E5DEE&\frz26.9\pos(44.181,193.909)}THUMP...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:16.27,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Tani-kun! G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:17.29,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:20.58,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Okay! I was able to say \Ngood morning naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:19.61,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HA2FFF8&\fnTrebuchet MS\3c&H7EAC4B&\shad2\4c&H7EAC4B&\frz26.68\move(141,50,116,62)\fad(1,359)}WHEW
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.25,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I'm so sleepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:24.78,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\fs36\c&H8714E8&\blur2\i1}BA-DUMPPPPP {\fs48\c&H74BEAF&\3c&H8417D6&}! !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:29.28,Basic Sign,SIGN sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs24\frz297.2\move(455,137,488,131,0,226)\c&H81F1B3&\3c&H96D21D&\4c&H96D21D&\shad1}FWOOSH
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:32.21,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.21,0:15:34.54,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh! Tani, morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:36.72,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:41.40,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, what were you \Nand Nishi-san talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.40,0:15:43.44,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh? Nishi-san? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:45.99,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Nothing. We said good morning. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.99,0:15:49.90,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Just normal stuff? You didn't do anything \Nthat would make her panic and run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:50.55,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.55,0:15:52.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.56,0:15:57.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What kind of girl is Nishi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.74,0:16:00.56,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.95,0:16:04.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, you do library work, so you've \Nbeen around her for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:06.63,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Have you talked about \Nlots of stuff together?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:09.22,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:09.57,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HA1D310&\fnTrebuchet MS\fad(397,1)\fs24\pos(378.636,65.455)}SILENCE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.35,0:16:13.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:19.64,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,He says the limited-time \Nbeef katsu roll is sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:20.79,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\an8\pos(330.182,12.909)\c&H845C11&\bord1}SHOPPING AT THE SCHOOL LUNCH COUNTER
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:20.56,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Confound it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.19,0:16:23.80,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Hey, Taira-kun? Can I ask \Nyour advice about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.80,0:16:24.44,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:26.43,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Asking me for advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.43,0:16:27.91,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,A-About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.73,0:16:33.30,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Suzuki is excessively interested in a girl \Nwho serves on the committee with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:38.30,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yes. She seems to have something specific \Nin mind, but I don't really understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:41.00,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I mean, it's gotta be that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.81,0:16:43.95,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,She finds you suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:45.82,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HCBFFFE&\3c&HA28007&\frz284.8\move(578,251,543,147)\fad(1,441)}WHAT...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:45.51,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:48.63,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Yup. You two seem like \Nyou get along, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:50.06,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Jealousy. It's jealousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:51.05,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.57,0:16:54.26,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything \Nto make her jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:59.08,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Actually, it's hard to imagine \NSuzuki-san feeling that way at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.52,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord3\fs48\fad(1,647)\c&HB3FEFB&\t(1114,2440,\fs20)\3c&HFA5EF1&}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.20,Default,Suzuki and friends,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.99,0:17:03.33,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,He has a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:06.18,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Well, if Suzuki really is jealous,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:08.76,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,then it's probably about \Nnot paying enough attention to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.76,0:17:10.37,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,It's okay for you to be angry, Tani.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.37,0:17:11.77,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Come on. Get angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:13.47,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b0\fnArial\fs16\move(66,229,181,229,1,479)}*THIS IS\NTAIRA'S\NSENSE OF\NFAIRNESS
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.77,0:17:13.47,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Do you want us to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:17.27,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Could it be that you'd \Nbe happy if she was jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:20.80,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. I see. That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:27.10,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,A part of you wants to think that she's \Njealous, even though it's hard to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:30.30,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,But you don't have enough confidence \Nin yourself to declare it with certainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.30,0:17:31.47,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.47,0:17:33.57,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:35.21,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:36.53,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:39.95,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,It's you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.25,0:17:40.50,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&H7B38F0&\pos(568,38)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.25,0:17:40.50,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HC7EA10&\pos(70.545,52.545)}SHOCK
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:41.87,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,When did you guys get so friendly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:42.58,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\c&HD9FFA7&\3c&H88A11A&\fs24\pos(501,23)\fad(1,394)}PANT
