Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:42.83,Basic Sign,SIGN; far left,0,0,0,,{\c&HDEF1A6&\3c&H9B7B1E&\fs24\fad(1,144)\pos(251,23)}GASP...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.62,0:17:43.33,Basic Sign,SIGN; far right,0,0,0,,{\c&HD9FFA7&\3c&H88A11A&\fs24\pos(585,88)\fad(1,310)}PANT
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:43.33,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&HDEF1A6&\3c&H9B7B1E&\fs24\fad(1,144)\pos(414.455,73.182)}GASP
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:44.08,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\c&HD9FFA7&\3c&H88A11A&\fs24\pos(501,23)\fad(1,394)}PANT
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:43.83,Basic Sign,SIGN; far left,0,0,0,,{\c&HDEF1A6&\3c&H9B7B1E&\fs24\fad(1,144)\pos(251,23)}GASP...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:44.33,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&HDEF1A6&\3c&H9B7B1E&\fs24\fad(1,144)\pos(414.455,73.182)}GASP
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.13,0:17:44.38,Basic Sign,SIGN; far right,0,0,0,,{\c&HD9FFA7&\3c&H88A11A&\fs24\pos(585,88)}PANT
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:46.23,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,You're really that surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:47.56,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why, but I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:50.63,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnComic Sans MS\c&H4C4E58&\3c&HF7F8F6&\frz349\pos(501,132)}AFTER SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.83,0:17:52.67,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, you have \Nlibrary duty again today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:53.64,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:55.76,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And Nishi-san will be there, naturally?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.42,0:17:58.17,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really? Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:02.89,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, is something \Nbothering you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:02.89,Default - Top,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Yay! Yay! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:04.52,Default - Top,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:04.52,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HB78FED&\3c&H690762&\fad(437,1)}YEEEEEEAH
