Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.61,0:18:08.53,Basic Sign,SIGN; lower left; bottom line,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnTrebuchet MS\frz21.87\c&H1EA8F5&\3c&H703CAC&\4c&HFFFFFF&\shad1\move(628,461,522,321,1,357)}CLEARANCE {\fnImpact}SALE!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.70,0:18:08.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow! This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:10.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yamada! Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:11.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:13.91,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's crazy!
