Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:25.54,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I was able to greet Tani-kun, but \Nthe moment I saw Yamada-kun, I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:29.30,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,And when I was finally able to talk to\Nhim a little better than I did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:31.20,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm going backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.72,0:18:37.44,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,Could it be that you'd be happy \Nif she was jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:39.06,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:41.10,Basic Sign,SIGN; right to left,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial\c&H977117&\3c&HFBFBEB&\pos(496,29)\an8}ABSOLUTELY\NDOES NOT APPLY
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:41.10,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial\c&H977117&\3c&HFBFBEB&\pos(405,29)\an8}DOES NOT\NQUITE APPLY
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:41.10,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial\c&H977117&\3c&HFBFBEB&\pos(317,26)\an8}NEITHER
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:41.10,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial\c&H977117&\3c&HFBFBEB&\pos(226,29)\an8}APPLIES\NSOMEWHAT
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:41.10,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial\c&H977117&\3c&HFBFBEB&\pos(138,29)\an8}ABSOLUTELY\NAPPLIES
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.18,Basic Sign,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\fs20\c&HBAF8E2&\3c&H9D7109&\pos(179,27)}MENTAL SURVEY SHEET
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:44.02,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:46.78,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,If one person's concern makes the other \Nperson feel happy in their heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.78,0:18:48.78,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,then that relationship isn't equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:49.57,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,And actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:53.12,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Even if you can't be totally clear, \Nor if you're still thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:57.57,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If you feel anxious and unsettled \Nfor some reason, just tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:19:00.30,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I feel that way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:04.33,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord1\c&HA365A8&\pos(478,100)\fad(1,187)}ANXIOUS
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:04.33,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord1\c&HA365A8&\pos(386,137.333)\fad(1,187)}ANXIOUS
