Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.21,0:19:04.71,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord1\c&HC1D885&\fad(231,229)\pos(524,81)}WORRY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:06.58,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,If there's something she wants \Nto say, I want her to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:05.08,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord1\c&HC19169&\fad(231,229)\pos(185.333,48)}WORRY
