Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.83,0:19:05.33,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord1\c&HC19169&\fad(231,229)\pos(365.333,92.666)}WORRY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.83,0:19:05.33,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord1\c&HC1D885&\fad(231,229)\pos(554,87)}WORRY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:11.09,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,And there's nothing for Suzuki-san \Nto feel uneasy about to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.09,0:19:13.87,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,It would be my own dishonor \Nif she suspected me of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,At this rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:20.10,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm certain I'm going to end up with \Nthe same regrets I had over summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:23.35,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Next time, I have to \Nmake sure not to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:26.43,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Wondering what she's planning, \Nwhat she's feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:29.11,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I won't find the answer \Nthinking on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:32.86,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Getting self-conscious for no reason \Nand panicking on my own is so unseemly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.13,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,The next time I see her...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:35.58,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,The next time I see him...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:36.50,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I will ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:37.86,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I will talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.63,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&H6927EA&\an9}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:52.88,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh! Nishi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:54.10,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,And Tani!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:54.98,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Good work on your shift!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:55.88,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:59.16,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Talk. Talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:04.39,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Wait... What do I do? Now that the moment \Nis here, I can't look him in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.03,0:20:15.20,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:16.82,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Nissan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.53,0:20:19.28,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Do you like bubbles?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.78,0:20:22.94,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We've already played with \Na bunch of stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:25.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,so right now, we're having a bubble-fest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:27.01,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,A bubble-fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.01,0:20:29.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You can use this if you'd like!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:31.63,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yamada's got the bubble liquid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:32.29,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:38.52,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\c&H911773&\3c&HF8F3FA&\frz16.65\pos(248,284)}Squeeze
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:39.30,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.81,0:20:42.12,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I gratefully accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.29,0:20:44.56,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,So formal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:45.72,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Come on over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.45,0:20:56.32,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:21:00.17,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, Nishi-san, \Nyou laugh a lot, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:00.70,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.70,0:21:02.38,Flashback Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:05.00,Flashback - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,I might be headed toward \Nfalling in love right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:10.16,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\b0\fs16\c&H506BE8&\3c&HE5FFFC&\frz9.176\fad(562,392)\move(112,322,112,194,1605,2564)}INFORMATION ON\NTHE GIRL GLEANED FROM\NCONVERSATIONS UP TO NOW
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.59,0:21:09.80,Flashback Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Same school, different class, shy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:10.16,Basic Sign,SIGN; top to bottom,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H9800DA&\3c&HE2BEFB&\fad(484,392)\move(260,364,260,236,1,984)}SAME SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:10.12,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H9800DA&\3c&HE2BEFB&\fad(484,392)\move(280,409,280,281,1,984)}DIFFERENT CLASS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:10.00,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H9800DA&\3c&HE2BEFB&\move(213,456,213,328,1,728)\fad(484,232)}SHY
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:12.21,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(466,334)\c&HE1FEFA&\3c&H336EF1&\bord3\fad(227,1)}MATCHES THE PROFILE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.32,0:21:12.21,Flashback - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:13.85,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,That's crazy good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:17.75,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,You're definitely better off \Nthe way you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:16.46,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&H8539EB&\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\pos(588,29)}THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:17.21,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&H8539EB&\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\pos(561,210)}THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:17.96,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&H8539EB&\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\pos(197,206)}THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:21.50,Flashback Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Is it Nishi-san? Is it Nishi-san, Yamada?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.21,0:21:18.72,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&H8539EB&\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\pos(588,29)}THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.97,0:21:19.47,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&H8539EB&\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\pos(561,210)}THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:20.22,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&H8539EB&\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\pos(197,206)}THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:20.97,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&H8539EB&\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\pos(588,29)}THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:21.55,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&H8539EB&\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\pos(561,210)}THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:23.76,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Then, this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:26.47,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\frz297.2\move(455,137,488,131,0,226)\c&H81F1B3&\3c&H96D21D&\4c&H96D21D&\shad1}FWOOSH
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.47,0:21:27.70,Flashback Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:29.59,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh! Tani, morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.37,0:21:32.11,Flashback Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.11,0:21:34.04,Flashback Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Her face went bright red and she ran?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:35.48,Flashback Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,After seeing Yamada?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.99,0:21:37.64,Flashback Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,This is already...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:41.18,Flashback Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,definitely mutual love, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.49,0:21:45.88,Default - Top,Watanabe; adlib,0,0,0,,Yay! Keep going! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:46.17,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I kept Yamada here \Nuntil the library closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:51.65,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, is the reason you asked about \NNishi-san so many times today because...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.65,0:21:53.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.75,0:21:56.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I wanted to know more \Nabout what kind of girl she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:58.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I mean, we want to be friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:00.24,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What kind of girl is Nishi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.26,0:22:04.83,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,She meant it exactly the way she said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.83,0:22:06.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? What? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:11.52,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H86FFCB&\3c&HAE2867&\fs24\pos(180.666,25.333)\an8}EMBARRASSED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.95,0:22:09.07,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Do you feel sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.07,0:22:10.26,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:11.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Why?!
